# inc-8chz B: Legend Lore rolls Knowledge (Magic) ONCE per magic item. Read by
# tools/check_legend_lore.sh (seed 1) with INCURSION_LEGEND_LORE_PROBE=1, from
# the frozen orc bard tools/fixtures/chars/orc-bard-reapply-seed1.sav (Legend
# Lore at 6th level, already in wizard mode, with Auto-Identify Items ON).
#
# Auto-Identify returns from Character::LegendIdent before Legend Lore runs
# (src/Skills.cpp), so the first step turns it OFF in the Wizard Mode Switches
# menu (DOWN, SPACE), as tools/keys/fire-ring-resist.keys turns it on.
#
# The item comes from wizard mode "Acquire Unknown Item" (an unidentified item;
# the fixture owns none), walking the acquisition list as
# tools/keys/acquire-blast-circlet.keys does. It lands in the In-the-Air slot
# (one LegendIdent call). Leaving the manager drops it to the floor, and each
# turn the floor sweep (Player, src/Player.cpp) calls LegendIdent on it again;
# those calls must NOT roll. The pickup is another call.
w
@choose "Wizard Mode Switches"
@dump:switches-before
DOWN
SPACE
@dump:switches-after
ESC

w
@choose "Acquire Unknown Item"
RIGHT*19
@until "Circlet of Blasting" DOWN
@expect "Circlet of Blasting"
DOWN
ENTER
@dump:acquired
ESC
@dump:left-manager
s
s
s
@dump:after-search
g
@dump:picked-up
ESC
s
s
@quit
